==========================================================================

  a_0 = 9.3624e-11 m/s^2
  loaded 862 Hyades tail stars with real Gaia astrometry
  median distance (cluster centre depth) = 55.1 pc
  transverse velocity dispersion (all) = 10050.687 km/s

